  description="What a well protector is, what kind of damage it prevents on wellhead and hanger sealing surfaces, when it's installed and removed, and why skipping it matters."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment' }, { label: 'Well Protector', href: '/equipment/well-protector' }]}
